<section id="about" class="section about">
    <div class="section-inner">
        <header class="section-head">
            <p class="section-label">About</p>
            <h2>Building reliable systems for money movement</h2>
        </header>
        <div class="about-body">
            <p class="about-summary">@ProfileData.Summary</p>
            <p class="about-objective">@ProfileData.Objective</p>
            <ul class="about-points">
                <li>Clean architecture &amp; SOLID in high-throughput transactional environments</li>
                <li>High-availability designs with gRPC, RabbitMQ, and API Gateway patterns</li>
                <li>Legacy modernization from .NET Framework / WCF to ASP.NET Core</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
